From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Wed, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] frontend: guard the sandbox status check on riscv64

The riscv64 build_dll job got past every prior GCC-compat and gn-arg
fix and ~99% into the ninja build (2155/2176), then failed compiling
mini_racer's own exports.cc:

  ../../custom_deps/mini_racer/exports.cc: In function
  'bool mr_v8_is_using_sandbox()':
  ../../custom_deps/mini_racer/exports.cc:180:18: error:
  'IsSandboxConfiguredSecurely' is not a member of 'v8::V8'
    180 |   return v8::V8::IsSandboxConfiguredSecurely();

v8::V8::IsSandboxConfiguredSecurely() (include/v8-initialization.h) is
declared only `#if defined(V8_ENABLE_SANDBOX)`. V8_ENABLE_SANDBOX
itself is off unless V8's sandbox is compiled in, and the sandbox
(BUILD.gn) defaults on only when pointer-compression-backed-by-a-
shared-cage is available, which in turn (gni/v8.gni) defaults true
only for v8_current_cpu == "arm64", "x64" or "loong64" -- riscv64 is
not in that list, and this port sets no gn arg to force it on. So on
riscv64 the sandbox is off by default and the API this function calls
unconditionally does not exist, whereas every architecture upstream
actually ships wheels for (x64/arm64, per .github/workflows/build.yml)
gets pointer compression, and hence the sandbox, on by default and
never hits this.

Guard the call the same way v8-initialization.h guards the API: when
V8_ENABLE_SANDBOX isn't defined there is no sandbox to speak of, so
report it as not securely configured (mirrors what a fallback,
insecure sandbox already reports via the same function).

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted to bpcreech/PyMiniRacer]

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 src/v8_py_frontend/exports.cc | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/v8_py_frontend/exports.cc b/src/v8_py_frontend/exports.cc
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/src/v8_py_frontend/exports.cc
+++ b/src/v8_py_frontend/exports.cc
@@ -177,7 +177,11 @@ LIB_EXPORT auto mr_v8_version() -> char const* {
 }

 LIB_EXPORT auto mr_v8_is_using_sandbox() -> bool {
+#if defined(V8_ENABLE_SANDBOX)
   return v8::V8::IsSandboxConfiguredSecurely();
+#else
+  return false;
+#endif
 }

 LIB_EXPORT auto mr_get_identity_hash(uint64_t context_id,
